20CC%20Values/","source-block-269","Control Change (CC) messages are separate from note-related MIDI messages. They let a MIDI-compatible device control parameters on another device.",["21.1 What are CC# values?"]],["Microfreak/UG/21%20Appendix%20D%20-%20CC%20Values/01%20What%20are%20CC%20Values/","source-block-419","Turning a MicroFreak knob transmits its CC message; sending that CC value to the MicroFreak changes the parameter as if the knob had been turned.",["21.1 What are CC# values?"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/","source-block-198","22. Declaration of Conformity",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-185","22.1 FCC",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-301","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-379","The unit must not cause harmful interference.",["22.1 FCC","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-429","The unit must accept interference it receives, including interference that may cause undesired operation.",["22.1 FCC","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-539","Responsible party in the United States",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-584","Zedra, 185 Alewife Brook Parkway, , Cambridge, MA 02138",["22.1 FCC","Responsible party in the United States"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-648","Telephone: +1 857 285 5953",["22.1 FCC","Responsible party in the United States"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-679","Trade name: ARTURIA",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-702","Model: MicroFreak",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-723","Testing found the unit within the FCC limits for a Class B digital device. Those limits aim to provide reasonable protection from harmful interference in residential installations.",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-907","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-989","Reorient or relocate the receiving antenna.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1037","Increase the distance between the unit and receiver.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1094","Connect the unit to an outlet on a different circuit from the receiver.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1170","Ask the dealer or an experienced radio/TV technician for help.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-242","22.2 Canada",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-258","The Class B digital apparatus complies with Canadian ICES-003.",["22.2 Canada"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-324","The French statement declares that Class B digital apparatus complies with Canadian standard NMB-003.",["22.2 Canada"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Decla